{
  "id": "22487_seiiku",
  "headword": "{生育|せいいく}",
  "reading": "せいいく",
  "romaji": "seiiku",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "growth; development (of plants or organisms)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "growth; development (of plants or organisms)",
      "explanation": "The process by which plants, crops, or other living organisms grow and develop. Primarily used in agricultural and biological contexts rather than for human growth."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "22487_seiiku_ex1",
      "japanese": "{植物|しょくぶつ}が{順調|じゅんちょう}に{生育|せいいく}している。",
      "english": "The plants are growing well.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "22487_seiiku_ex2",
      "japanese": "{日当|ひあ}たりが{悪|わる}いと{生育|せいいく}に{影響|えいきょう}する。",
      "english": "Poor sunlight affects growth.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "22487_seiiku_ex3",
      "japanese": "この{品種|ひんしゅ}は{寒冷|かんれい}な{気候|きこう}でも{生育|せいいく}できる。",
      "english": "This variety can grow even in cold climates.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Primarily used for the growth and development of plants, crops, and other organisms. While it can occasionally apply to human growth, {成長|せいちょう} and {発育|はついく} are far more common for people.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {生育|せいいく}{環境|かんきょう}: growing environment\n- {生育|せいいく}{条件|じょうけん}: growth conditions\n- {生育|せいいく}{状況|じょうきょう}: growth status\n- {生育|せいいく}{期間|きかん}: growing period\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {成長|せいちょう}: growth — the most general term; used for people, businesses, economies, and plants\n- {発育|はついく}: physical development — mainly used for human physical growth, especially of children\n- {生長|せいちょう}: growth (of plants) — close synonym sometimes used interchangeably with {生育|せいいく}",
